# Commits that only reformat code (a formatter or linter fix run across many
# files). GitHub's blame view skips them, so each line keeps its real author.
# Add the full SHA of the squash commit on main after it merges, with a
# comment that says what it did. To skip them in local blame too, run once
# per clone:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
